  "error_no_pages": "<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/google-calendar-color.svg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/google-drive-color.svg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/claude-color.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/openai.png"/><div><h1 class="title">אינטגרציות</h1><p class="mt-2 mb-8 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">חברו כאן את המערכות שמהן מגיעים הלידים, ואת הכלים שעוזרים לטפל בהם. החיבור מתבצע פעם אחת.</p><section class="mb-10"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark">מקורות לידים</h2><p class="mt-1 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600">מכאן נכנסים לידים חדשים למערכת, אוטומטית.</p><div class="max-w-lg"><div class="accordion border rounded-lg bg-white"><details id="facebook" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0" open="" data-edu="facebook-section"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#1877F2] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#1877F2] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">פייסבוק</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-4"><div role="status" class="rounded-md border p-3 border-red-200 bg-red-50"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-800">לא מצאנו דף Facebook שאפשר לחבר</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-700">התחברנו לחשבון Facebook, אבל לא קיבלנו ממנו דף שאפשר לחבר ל-SocialCRM.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-red-700/80">בדרך כלל בגלל:</p><ul class="mt-0.5 list-disc ps-5 text-sm text-red-700"><li>ייתכן שההתחברות בוצעה עם חשבון שאינו מנהל את הדף</li><li>ייתכן שהדף לא נבחר במסך האישור של Facebook</li><li>אם עדיין אין דף עסקי — צריך ליצור אחד</li></ul><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-red-700">כדאי לוודא שאתם מחוברים לחשבון שמנהל את הדף ולבחור בו במסך האישור, ואז לנסות שוב.</p></div><div data-edu="facebook-connect" class="w-fit"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-solid text-white hover:bg-solid/85 h-10 px-4 gap-3 w-fit"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-white size-4 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/sol/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><span>בדקתי את הדף והגישה, לנסות להתחבר שוב</span></button></div></div><!--/$--></div></details><details id="whatsapp" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0" data-edu="whatsapp-section"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#25D366] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#25D366] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">וואטסאפ</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-4" data-edu="whatsapp-connect"><p class="text-sm text-green-600">החיבור תקין — לידים מגיעים אוטומטית</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3"><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border bg-white h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px] w-fit border-red-200 text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50"><span>נתק וואטסאפ</span></button></div></div><!--/$--></div></details><details id="templates" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#25D366] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#25D366] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">הודעות WhatsApp מוכנות</p><!--$--><span class="flex items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1 px-1.5 py-0.5 text-[10px] leading-tight " style="background-color:var(