ex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>נתק את Cursor</span></button></div><ul class="list-disc ps-[3.25rem] text-xs text-gray-600"><li class="desktop:whitespace-nowrap">צפייה בלידים שלך, במעקבים ובסיכום היומי</li><li class="desktop:whitespace-nowrap">צפייה בסיכומי שיחות WhatsApp עם הלידים שלך, ובהודעות עצמן לפי בקשה</li></ul></li></ul><details id="ai-connections-howto" class="group/howto"><summary class="flex w-fit cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-solid [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-3 bg-solid transition-transform duration-200 group-open/howto:rotate-180 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/chevron-down.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/chevron-down.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div>איך מתחברים?</summary><ol class="mt-2.5 list-decimal space-y-1.5 ps-5 text-sm text-gray-600"><li>פותחים את Claude או ChatGPT</li><li>מוסיפים חיבור MCP חדש</li><li><div class="grid gap-1.5 min-w-0"><span class="text-sm text-gray-500">מזינים:</span><div class="flex items-start gap-2 min-w-0"><code dir="ltr" class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-all rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-800">https://mcp.example.test/mcp</code><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/copy.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/copy.svg);mask-repeat:no-re