  "notConnected": "<link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/google-calendar-color.svg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/google-drive-color.svg"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/claude-color.png"/><link rel="preload" as="image" href="/media/social-icons/openai.png"/><div><h1 class="title">אינטגרציות</h1><p class="mt-2 mb-8 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">חברו כאן את המערכות שמהן מגיעים הלידים, ואת הכלים שעוזרים לטפל בהם. החיבור מתבצע פעם אחת.</p><section class="mb-10"><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark">מקורות לידים</h2><p class="mt-1 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600">מכאן נכנסים לידים חדשים למערכת, אוטומטית.</p><div class="max-w-lg"><div class="accordion border rounded-lg bg-white"><details id="facebook" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0" open="" data-edu="facebook-section"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#1877F2] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#1877F2] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">פייסבוק</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></