 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px] w-fit border-red-200 text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50"><span>נתק וואטסאפ</span></button></div></div><!--/$--></div></details><details id="messenger" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#1877F2] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#1877F2] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/facebook.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">הודעת פתיחה ותפריט ב-Messenger</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-5"><div><label for="messenger-greeting" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-900">הודעת פתיחה</label><p class="mt-0.5 text-xs text-gray-500">מוצגת לפונה לפני ההודעה הראשונה שלו, כשהוא פותח את השיחה עם הדף.</p><textarea id="messenger-greeting" rows="2" placeholder="היי! כתבו לנו ונחזור אליכם בהקדם." class="mt-1.5 w-full resize-none rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-gray-900 placeholder:text-gray-400 focus:border-primary focus:outline-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-primary disabled:opacity-50">שלום! איך אפשר לעזור?</textarea><p class="mt-0.5 tex