unded-md border border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">הצעה אחרונה</p><p class="line-clamp-1 text-sm text-gray-500">קנו עכשיו!!!</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs " style="background-color:var(--color-error-bg);color:var(--color-error-text);border-color:var(--color-error-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1.5 " style="background-color:var(--color-error-dot)"></span>נדחתה</span><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>עריכה ושליחה מחדש</span></button><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-transparent text-black hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><span>הסר</span></button></div></div><div class="mt-2"><div role="status" class="rounded-md border p-3 border-red-200 bg-red-50"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-800">ההודעה לא אושרה</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-700">ההודעה לא אושרה — התוכן נוגד את מדיניות וואטסאפ. כדאי לנסח מחדש בלי תוכן שיווקי אגרסיבי.</p></div></div></div></li><li><div class="rounded-md border border-gray-200 p-3"><div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><div class="min-w-0"><p class="truncate text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">מבצע חגים</p><p class="line-clamp-1 text-sm text-gray-500">מבצע מיוחד לחגים!</p></div><div class="flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1"><span class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-full border font-medium tabular-nums gap-1.5 px-2 py-0.5 text-xs " style="background-color:var(--color-warning-bg);color:var(--color-warning-text);border-color:var(--color-warning-border)"><span class="shrink-0 rounded-full size-1.5 animate-pulse" style="background-