/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">הודעות WhatsApp מוכנות</p><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-3"><div role="status" class="rounded-md border p-3 border-amber-300 bg-amber-50"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-amber-800">צריך לחבר וואטסאפ עסקי</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-amber-700">כדי ליצור הודעות WhatsApp מוכנות, חברו קודם את מספר הוואטסאפ העסקי.</p></div><a class="text-sm font-medium text-primary hover:underline" href="/settings/integrations?section=whatsapp">למעבר לחיבור וואטסאפ</a></div><!--/$--></div></details></div></div></section><section><h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-dark">כלים מחוברים</h2><p class="mt-1 mb-4 max-w-2xl text-sm text-gray-600">שירותים חיצוניים שמעשירים את הלידים הקיימים.</p><div class="grid max-w-3xl grid-cols-2 gap-4 mobile:grid-cols-1"><div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><img src="/media/social-icons/google-calendar-color.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="size-7 shrink-0 object-contain"/><h3 class="text-lg font-bold">Google Calendar</h3><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-4 bg-green-600 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></div><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">תזמון פגישות עם לידים וקישורי Google Meet אוטומטיים, ישירות מתוך ה-CRM.</p><div class="mt-auto flex items-center justify-between gap-3"><span class="min-w-0 truncate text-sm text-gray-600">מחובר · <span class="font-medium text-gray-800">dana@gmail.test</span></span><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>נתק חשבון</span></button></div></div><div class="rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><img src="/media/social-icons/google-drive-color.svg" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="size-7 shrink-0 object-contain"/><h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-dark">Google Drive</h3></div><p class="text-sm text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">חיפוש, צירוף וניתוח של קבצים מ-Drive ישירות בתוך הלידים ובעוזר החכם.</p><div class="mt-auto h-9 flex items-center text-sm text-gray-400">טוען…</div></div><div class="col-span-2 mobile:col-span-1 rounded-lg border border-gray-200 bg-white p-6 flex flex-col gap-4"><div class="flex items-center gap-2.5"><h3 class="text-lg font-bold">חיבורי AI</h3><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-4 bg-green-600 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></div><div class="flex flex-col gap-1"><p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">חברו את SocialCRM ל-Claude או ChatGPT כדי לשאול על לידים, מעקבים ושיחות.</p><p class="text-xs text-gray-500">הגישה מוגבלת לנתונים שאתם מורשים לראות. מספרי טלפון ואימיילים אינם נשלחים.</p></div><ul class="divide-y divide-gray-100 rounded-md border border-gray-100"><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img src="/media/social-icons/claude-color.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="max-h-7 max-w-7 object-contain"/></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Claude</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-green-700"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-3 bg-green-600 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div>מחובר</span><span>· מאז 1.10.2026</span><span>· שימוש אחרון 27.10.2026</span></div></div><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>נתק את Claude</span></button></div><ul class="list-disc ps-[3.25rem] text-xs text-gray-600"><li class="desktop:whitespace-nowrap">צפייה בלידים שלך, במעקבים ובסיכום היומי</li></ul></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><img src="/media/social-icons/openai.png" alt="" aria-hidden="true" class="max-h-7 max-w-7 object-contain"/></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">ChatGPT</p><div class="text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="text-gray-400">לא מחובר עדיין</span> · החיבור מתחיל מתוך ChatGPT</div></div><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]" aria-controls="ai-connections-howto"><span>הוראות חיבור</span></button></div></li><li class="flex flex-col gap-2 px-4 py-3"><div class="flex items-center gap-3"><span class="flex size-7 shrink-0 items-center justify-center"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-5 bg-gray-400 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plug.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/plug.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></span><div class="min-w-0 flex-1"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800">Cursor</p><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-1.5 text-xs text-gray-500"><span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-green-700"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-3 bg-green-600 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/check.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div>מחובר</span><span>· מאז 20.10.2026</span><span>· שימוש אחרון —</span></div></div><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-10 px-4 gap-3"><span>נתק את Cursor</span></button></div><ul class="list-disc ps-[3.25rem] text-xs text-gray-600"><li class="desktop:whitespace-nowrap">צפייה בלידים שלך, במעקבים ובסיכום היומי</li><li class="desktop:whitespace-nowrap">צפייה בסיכומי שיחות WhatsApp עם הלידים שלך, ובהודעות עצמן לפי בקשה</li></ul></li></ul><details id="ai-connections-howto" class="group/howto"><summary class="flex w-fit cursor-pointer list-none items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-solid [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white size-3 bg-solid transition-transform duration-200 group-open/howto:rotate-180 " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/chevron-down.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/chevron-down.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div>איך מתחברים?</summary><ol class="mt-2.5 list-decimal space-y-1.5 ps-5 text-sm text-gray-600"><li>פותחים את Claude או ChatGPT</li><li>מוסיפים חיבור MCP חדש</li><li><div class="grid gap-1.5 min-w-0"><span class="text-sm text-gray-500">מזינים:</span><div class="flex items-start gap-2 min-w-0"><code dir="ltr" class="min-w-0 flex-1 break-all rounded-md border border-gray-200 bg-gray-50 px-3 py-2 text-xs leading-relaxed text-gray-800">https://mcp.example.test/mcp</code><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap border text-black border-gray-200 bg-white hover:bg-gray-100/60 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px]"><div aria-hidden="true" class="dark:bg-white bg-black size-[15px] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/copy.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/copy.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size