mmary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-4"><p class="text-sm text-gray-600" data-edu="facebook-connect">מחובר לדף: <strong>סטודיו דנה</strong></p><p class="text-sm text-green-600">החיבור תקין  לידים מגיעים אוטומטית</p><button class="flex items-center min-w-fit justify-center font-medium rounded-md flex-nowrap bg-red-600 text-white hover:bg-red-700 h-9 px-3 gap-3 text-[15px] w-fit"><span>נתק דף</span></button></div><!--/$--></div></details><details id="whatsapp" name="x" class="group/acrdn border-b-2 last:border-b-0" open="" data-edu="whatsapp-section"><summary><div class="flex items-center gap-2"><div aria-hidden="true" class="size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white bg-[#25D366] group-open/acrdn:bg-[#25D366] " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/reg/whatsapp.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div><p class="group-open/acrdn:text-solid">וואטסאפ</p></div><div aria-hidden="true" class="bg-gray-800 size-[18.5px] dark:bg-white duration-200 group-hover/acrdn:bg-gray-950 group-open/acrdn:rotate-90 group-open/acrdn:bg-solid " style="mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);-webkit-mask-image:url(https://res.cloudinary.com/dfletli2x/image/upload/icons/lit/chevron-left.svg);mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-position:center;-webkit-mask-position:center;mask-size:contain;-webkit-mask-size:contain;mask-type:alpha"></div></summary><div class="p-6"><!--$--><div class="grid gap-4"><div role="status" class="rounded-md border p-3 border-red-200 bg-red-50"><p class="text-sm font-medium text-red-800">חלון ההתחברות לא נפתח</p><p class="mt-1 text-sm text-red-700">הדפדפן חסם את רכיב ההתחברות של פייסבוק.</p><p class="mt-2 text-xs text-red-700/80">ב